				<br>
               <<investigateicon>><<link [[살펴본다 (0:05)|Photo Examine]]>><<set $pubfame.niki.examined to true>><</link>>
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>

		<<if $photo.shoot is 1>>
           <<ind>><span class="blue">이번 주에는 이미 모델로 일했습니다.</span>
			<br>
